## syntax highlighting for gemini:// markup language

syntax gemini "\.(gemini|gmi)$"

# No comments
comment ""

# Heading levels
color brightgreen "^#.*"
color brightcyan "^##.*"
color brightmagenta "^###.*"

# Link Text
color brightred "^=>\s*\S+\s+.*"
# Link URL
color green "^=>\s*\S+"
# Link Prefix
color yellow "^=>"

# Bullet Lists
color blue "^\*.*"
color brightblue "^\*"

# Quote lines
color orange,black "^>.*"
color orange "^>"

# Monospaced Blocks
color white,black start="^```" end="^```"
color gray,black "^```.+"
color white,black "^```"
